# ORCA 6.1 spin-state examples.
# Multiplicity is the second number after xyz.

! TPSSh D4 def2-TZVP RIJCOSX TightSCF SP
%pal nprocs 8 end
%maxcore 2000

# Singlet neutral: * xyz 0 1
# Doublet neutral radical: * xyz 0 2
# Triplet neutral: * xyz 0 3
# Quartet neutral: * xyz 0 4
# Cationic doublet: * xyz 1 2
# Anionic doublet: * xyz -1 2

* xyz 0 1
O  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000
O  0.000000  0.000000  1.210000
*
